            <h3>Planning an installation?</h3>
            <p>Tell us what you're adding and where it will go. For new lighting, it helps to know whether a fixture is already there and whether there's an attic above it. For a hot tub or sauna, the model and location give us a place to start.</p>
            <p>The form guides you through the details. You can also type a message. We'll follow up and arrange a look at the job when we need one to price the work.</p>
